Skylink

Skylink is a clone of bluesky built with PHP, MySQL, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS, and PDO.  
The platform allows users to create posts, comment, follow other users, send dms, and interact through likes, favorites, and reposts.

---

Features

User System
- Registration and login
- Secure password hashing
- Logout functionality
- Account settings

Posts
- Create posts
- Like posts
- Favorite posts
- Repost posts
- Comment on posts
- Reply to comments
- Reply to replies
- Delete own posts/comments/replies

Profiles
- Custom profile picture
- Custom banner image
- Editable bio
- Follow / unfollow users
- Followers & following system
- Profile tabs:
  - Posts
  - Likes
  - Favorites

Messaging
- Direct messaging system
- Chat list page
- Real-time styled conversation layout

Admin Features
- Delete users
- Promote/remove admins
- Delete posts

UI / UX
- Responsive layout
- Mobile navigation bar
- Tailwind CSS styling
- Modal popups

Database
Main tables include:
    users
    posts
    comments
    likes
    favorites
    reposts
    follows
    dms
    comment_likes
    comment_favorites

Stuff used to make the webstie
- PHP
- MySQL
- HeidiSQL
- PDO
- JavaScript
- Tailwind CSS
- HTML5